  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peru - Cacao Import</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF Start-up Loan Crafting Markets will be able to work together with various local sourcing partners in scaling up its cocoa import and distribution.Crafting Markets BV is a start-up company active in the specialty cocoa sector as an importer and distributor. Crafting Markets BV works together with 19 local producers/sourcing partners in various countries. The top 5 sourcing countries in terms of volume are Ghana, Nicaragua, Peru, Tanzania and Uganda. The imported cocoa will then be sold in the Netherlands and Europe.The expected impact is local employment for 6,000 smallholder farmers.Prior to this financing, Crafting Martkets BV received a DGGF TA pre-financing for the first cocoa shipments.</narrative>
  </description>
